<h2>Verify Your Email Address</h2>

<p>Hi {{name}},</p>

<p>Thanks for signing up! Please verify your email address to activate your account and unlock all features.</p>

<p style="text-align: center;">
    <a href="{{verifyUrl}}" class="button">Verify Email</a>
</p>

<p><strong>Why verify your email?</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li>✅ Secure your account</li>
    <li>✅ Receive important notifications</li>
    <li>✅ Reset your password if needed</li>
    <li>✅ Get updates about your profile</li>
</ul>

<p>This verification link will expire in <strong>{{expiresIn}}</strong>.</p>

<p>If you're having trouble clicking the button, copy and paste this URL into your browser:</p>
<p style="word-break: break-all; color: #667eea;">{{verifyUrl}}</p>

<p>If you didn't create an account with Lab Project, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>The Lab Project Team</p>